{"id": "tpch-001", "level": "noob", "nl_description": "were a parts distributon company and we need to track our stuff. We have supliers from diffrant countrys and custumers all over the world. Countries are grouped into like 5 big regions. Each country belongs to one region. Suppliers and customers both have acount balances that can sometimes go nagative. We take orders from customers and each order can have many items. Like if someone orders bolts and screws in one order thats 2 diffrent line items. For each line item we know the quantity (like between 1 and 50 pieces), and theres a discount applied which is never more than 10 percent, and also tax. We have a catalog of parts with retail prices. Suppliers offer parts at supply costs and we track how many of each is avalable.", "ground_truth_schema": {"tables": [{"name": "REGION", "pk": "r_regionkey", "columns": [{"name": "r_regionkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "r_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "NATION", "pk": "n_nationkey", "columns": [{"name": "n_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "n_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "n_regionkey", "data_type": "INT"}]}, {"name": "SUPPLIER", "pk": "s_suppkey", "columns": [{"name": "s_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_acctbal", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "CUSTOMER", "pk": "c_custkey", "columns": [{"name": "c_custkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_acctbal", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "PART", "pk": "p_partkey", "columns": [{"name": "p_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "p_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_retailprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "PARTSUPP", "pk": "ps_partkey", "columns": [{"name": "ps_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_availqty", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_supplycost", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "ORDER", "pk": "o_orderkey", "columns": [{"name": "o_orderkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_custkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_orderstatus", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "o_totalprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "o_orderdate", "data_type": "DATE"}]}, {"name": "LINEITEM", "pk": "l_orderkey", "columns": [{"name": "l_orderkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_linenumber", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_quantity", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_extendedprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_discount", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_tax", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}], "relationships": [{"referencing_table": "NATION", "referencing_column": "n_regionkey", "referred_table": "REGION"}, {"referencing_table": "SUPPLIER", "referencing_column": "s_nationkey", "referred_table": "NATION"}, {"referencing_table": "CUSTOMER", "referencing_column": "c_nationkey", "referred_table": "NATION"}, {"referencing_table": "PARTSUPP", "referencing_column": "ps_suppkey", "referred_table": "SUPPLIER"}, {"referencing_table": "PARTSUPP", "referencing_column": "ps_partkey", "referred_table": "PART"}, {"referencing_table": "ORDER", "referencing_column": "o_custkey", "referred_table": "CUSTOMER"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_orderkey", "referred_table": "ORDER"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_partkey", "referred_table": "PART"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_suppkey", "referred_table": "SUPPLIER"}]}, "ground_truth_distributions": {"LINEITEM.l_quantity": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 50.0}}, "LINEITEM.l_discount": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 0.1}}, "LINEITEM.l_tax": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 0.08}}, "PART.p_retailprice": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 900.0, "high": 2099.99}}, "PARTSUPP.ps_availqty": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 9999.0}}, "PARTSUPP.ps_supplycost": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 1000.0}}, "SUPPLIER.s_acctbal": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": -999.99, "high": 9999.99}}, "CUSTOMER.c_acctbal": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": -999.99, "high": 9999.99}}}}
{"id": "tpch-002", "level": "noob", "nl_description": "My freind has a small wholesale buisness selling industrial components. He buys from manufactures and resells to other companys. I need to help him build a database. He has a list of parts he deals with -- each part has a name, a retail price, a physical size (small to large), and comes in diffrent packaging options. Several supliers can provde the same part but at diffrent prices, and each supplier has diferent stock levels. He also has a list of customers in diffrent countries. Customers place orders with him. Each order is made up of line items. Line items have the part and suplier info, plus a quantity (max 50 per line), any discount he gives (he said never more than 10 percent), and applicable taxes.", "ground_truth_schema": {"tables": [{"name": "NATION", "pk": "n_nationkey", "columns": [{"name": "n_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "n_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "SUPPLIER", "pk": "s_suppkey", "columns": [{"name": "s_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_acctbal", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "CUSTOMER", "pk": "c_custkey", "columns": [{"name": "c_custkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_acctbal", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "PART", "pk": "p_partkey", "columns": [{"name": "p_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "p_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_mfgr", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_brand", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_type", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_size", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "p_container", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_retailprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "PARTSUPP", "pk": "ps_partkey", "columns": [{"name": "ps_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_availqty", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_supplycost", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "ORDER", "pk": "o_orderkey", "columns": [{"name": "o_orderkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_custkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_totalprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "o_orderdate", "data_type": "DATE"}]}, {"name": "LINEITEM", "pk": "l_orderkey", "columns": [{"name": "l_orderkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_quantity", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_extendedprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_discount", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_tax", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_shipdate", "data_type": "DATE"}]}], "relationships": [{"referencing_table": "SUPPLIER", "referencing_column": "s_nationkey", "referred_table": "NATION"}, {"referencing_table": "CUSTOMER", "referencing_column": "c_nationkey", "referred_table": "NATION"}, {"referencing_table": "PARTSUPP", "referencing_column": "ps_suppkey", "referred_table": "SUPPLIER"}, {"referencing_table": "PARTSUPP", "referencing_column": "ps_partkey", "referred_table": "PART"}, {"referencing_table": "ORDER", "referencing_column": "o_custkey", "referred_table": "CUSTOMER"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_orderkey", "referred_table": "ORDER"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_partkey", "referred_table": "PART"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_suppkey", "referred_table": "SUPPLIER"}]}, "ground_truth_distributions": {"LINEITEM.l_quantity": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 50.0}}, "LINEITEM.l_discount": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 0.1}}, "LINEITEM.l_tax": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 0.08}}, "PART.p_retailprice": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 900.0, "high": 2099.99}}, "PART.p_size": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 50.0}}, "PARTSUPP.ps_availqty": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 9999.0}}, "PARTSUPP.ps_supplycost": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 1000.0}}}}
{"id": "tpch-003", "level": "intermediate", "nl_description": "Design a database for an international B2B parts distribution platform. The geographic model has two levels: major world regions at the top (five of them), with individual countries nested underneath. Suppliers and customers are each associated with a country. Account balances for both suppliers and customers range from around -$1000 to +$10000. The parts catalog has items characterized by manufacturer, brand, physical type, size (1 to 50), and container packaging. A supplier-part relationship table captures the supply cost and available inventory for every supplier-part combination -- supply costs are between $1 and $1000, and stock levels go up to 9999 units. Customers place purchase orders. Each order has a status (open, fulfilled, or partially done) and a priority level. Orders are composed of line items, each referencing exactly one part from exactly one supplier. Line item quantities are between 1 and 50 units; discounts are capped at 10%; a small tax also applies. The total order amount is derived from the extended line item prices adjusted for discounts and tax.", "ground_truth_schema": {"tables": [{"name": "REGION", "pk": "r_regionkey", "columns": [{"name": "r_regionkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "r_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "r_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "NATION", "pk": "n_nationkey", "columns": [{"name": "n_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "n_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "n_regionkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "n_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "SUPPLIER", "pk": "s_suppkey", "columns": [{"name": "s_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_address", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_phone", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_acctbal", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "s_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "CUSTOMER", "pk": "c_custkey", "columns": [{"name": "c_custkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_address", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_phone", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_acctbal", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "c_mktsegment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "PART", "pk": "p_partkey", "columns": [{"name": "p_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "p_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_mfgr", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_brand", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_type", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_size", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "p_container", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_retailprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "p_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "PARTSUPP", "pk": "ps_partkey", "columns": [{"name": "ps_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_availqty", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_supplycost", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ps_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "ORDER", "pk": "o_orderkey", "columns": [{"name": "o_orderkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_custkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_orderstatus", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "o_totalprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "o_orderdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "o_orderpriority", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "o_clerk", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "o_shippriority", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "LINEITEM", "pk": "l_orderkey", "columns": [{"name": "l_orderkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_linenumber", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_quantity", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_extendedprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_discount", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_tax", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_returnflag", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_linestatus", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_shipdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "l_commitdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "l_receiptdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "l_shipinstruct", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_shipmode", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}], "relationships": [{"referencing_table": "NATION", "referencing_column": "n_regionkey", "referred_table": "REGION"}, {"referencing_table": "SUPPLIER", "referencing_column": "s_nationkey", "referred_table": "NATION"}, {"referencing_table": "CUSTOMER", "referencing_column": "c_nationkey", "referred_table": "NATION"}, {"referencing_table": "PARTSUPP", "referencing_column": "ps_suppkey", "referred_table": "SUPPLIER"}, {"referencing_table": "PARTSUPP", "referencing_column": "ps_partkey", "referred_table": "PART"}, {"referencing_table": "ORDER", "referencing_column": "o_custkey", "referred_table": "CUSTOMER"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_orderkey", "referred_table": "ORDER"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_partkey", "referred_table": "PART"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_suppkey", "referred_table": "SUPPLIER"}]}, "ground_truth_distributions": {"LINEITEM.l_quantity": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 50.0}}, "LINEITEM.l_discount": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 0.1}}, "LINEITEM.l_tax": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 0.08}}, "PART.p_retailprice": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 900.0, "high": 2099.99}}, "PART.p_size": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 50.0}}, "PARTSUPP.ps_availqty": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 9999.0}}, "PARTSUPP.ps_supplycost": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 1000.0}}, "SUPPLIER.s_acctbal": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": -999.99, "high": 9999.99}}, "CUSTOMER.c_acctbal": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": -999.99, "high": 9999.99}}}}
{"id": "tpch-004", "level": "intermediate", "nl_description": "We need a relational schema for a global industrial components marketplace -- a supplier-to-business trading platform. There's a world geography model where countries belong to continents; there are five continents total. Manufacturers produce parts: each part has a retail price, a size code between 1 and 50, and can be packaged in various container formats (small case, large drum, etc.). A given part is usually available from multiple vendors, each with their own unit supply cost and inventory. On the demand side, corporate buyers place multi-line purchase orders. Orders have a priority rating from urgent down to low, and go through open, fulfilled, and partial states. Each line item in an order specifies the part, the vendor supplying it, how many units are needed (at most 50), and a shipment mode -- there are seven possible shipping modes. Ship date comes after order date; receipt comes after shipment. A small discount sometimes knocks off up to 10% of the price; tax rate is similarly small. The line-level charge is quantity times the retail price, adjusted by both.", "ground_truth_schema": {"tables": [{"name": "REGION", "pk": "r_regionkey", "columns": [{"name": "r_regionkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "r_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "NATION", "pk": "n_nationkey", "columns": [{"name": "n_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "n_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "n_regionkey", "data_type": "INT"}]}, {"name": "SUPPLIER", "pk": "s_suppkey", "columns": [{"name": "s_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_address", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_phone", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_acctbal", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "CUSTOMER", "pk": "c_custkey", "columns": [{"name": "c_custkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_acctbal", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "c_mktsegment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "PART", "pk": "p_partkey", "columns": [{"name": "p_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "p_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_mfgr", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_brand", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_type", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_size", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "p_container", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_retailprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "PARTSUPP", "pk": "ps_partkey", "columns": [{"name": "ps_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_availqty", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_supplycost", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "ORDER", "pk": "o_orderkey", "columns": [{"name": "o_orderkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_custkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_orderstatus", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "o_totalprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "o_orderdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "o_orderpriority", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "LINEITEM", "pk": "l_orderkey", "columns": [{"name": "l_orderkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_linenumber", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_quantity", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_extendedprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_discount", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_tax", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_returnflag", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_linestatus", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_shipdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "l_commitdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "l_receiptdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "l_shipinstruct", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_shipmode", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}], "relationships": [{"referencing_table": "NATION", "referencing_column": "n_regionkey", "referred_table": "REGION"}, {"referencing_table": "SUPPLIER", "referencing_column": "s_nationkey", "referred_table": "NATION"}, {"referencing_table": "CUSTOMER", "referencing_column": "c_nationkey", "referred_table": "NATION"}, {"referencing_table": "PARTSUPP", "referencing_column": "ps_suppkey", "referred_table": "SUPPLIER"}, {"referencing_table": "PARTSUPP", "referencing_column": "ps_partkey", "referred_table": "PART"}, {"referencing_table": "ORDER", "referencing_column": "o_custkey", "referred_table": "CUSTOMER"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_orderkey", "referred_table": "ORDER"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_partkey", "referred_table": "PART"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_suppkey", "referred_table": "SUPPLIER"}]}, "ground_truth_distributions": {"LINEITEM.l_quantity": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 50.0}}, "LINEITEM.l_discount": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 0.1}}, "LINEITEM.l_tax": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 0.08}}, "PART.p_retailprice": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 900.0, "high": 2099.99}}, "PART.p_size": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 50.0}}, "PARTSUPP.ps_availqty": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 9999.0}}, "PARTSUPP.ps_supplycost": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 1000.0}}, "SUPPLIER.s_acctbal": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": -999.99, "high": 9999.99}}, "CUSTOMER.c_acctbal": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": -999.99, "high": 9999.99}}}}
{"id": "tpch-005", "level": "expert", "nl_description": "Schema for a decision-support procurement analytics system. Two-level geographic hierarchy: five named regions, approximately five nations per region (25 total). Approximately 10K suppliers and 150K customers, each tagged to a nation. Parts catalog with roughly 200K distinct items, each with a manufacturer code (five manufacturers), a brand (25 brands in a 5x5 grid), a type code from 150 possible combinations, a physical size integer uniformly distributed in [1, 50], a container type from 40 possible values, and a list retail price in the range [900, 2100] derived deterministically from the part key. Supply catalog: each (part, supplier) pair carries a unit supply cost uniform in [1.00, 1000.00] and available inventory uniform in [1, 9999]; on average each part has four qualified suppliers. Order volume approximately 1.5M order headers, average four line items per order up to a maximum of seven, yielding roughly 6M LINEITEM records. Line item quantity uniform integer in [1, 50]. Discount applied per line is a two-decimal value drawn uniformly from {0.00, 0.01, ..., 0.10}. Tax rate similarly uniform over {0.00, ..., 0.08}. Extended price = quantity * part retail price. Net charge = extended_price * (1 - discount) * (1 + tax). Order total is the sum of net charges. Account balances for both suppliers and customers are uniform in [-999.99, 9999.99]. Customers are partitioned into five market segments with equal probability. Order status derived: F when all lines fulfilled, O when all open, P when mixed.", "ground_truth_schema": {"tables": [{"name": "REGION", "pk": "r_regionkey", "columns": [{"name": "r_regionkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "r_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "r_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "NATION", "pk": "n_nationkey", "columns": [{"name": "n_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "n_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "n_regionkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "n_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "SUPPLIER", "pk": "s_suppkey", "columns": [{"name": "s_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_address", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_phone", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_acctbal", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "s_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "CUSTOMER", "pk": "c_custkey", "columns": [{"name": "c_custkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_address", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_phone", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_acctbal", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "c_mktsegment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "PART", "pk": "p_partkey", "columns": [{"name": "p_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "p_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_mfgr", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_brand", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_type", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_size", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "p_container", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_retailprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "p_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "PARTSUPP", "pk": "ps_partkey", "columns": [{"name": "ps_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_availqty", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_supplycost", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ps_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "ORDER", "pk": "o_orderkey", "columns": [{"name": "o_orderkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_custkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_orderstatus", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "o_totalprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "o_orderdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "o_orderpriority", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "o_clerk", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "o_shippriority", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "LINEITEM", "pk": "l_orderkey", "columns": [{"name": "l_orderkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_linenumber", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_quantity", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_extendedprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_discount", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_tax", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_returnflag", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_linestatus", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_shipdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "l_commitdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "l_receiptdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "l_shipinstruct", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_shipmode", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}], "relationships": [{"referencing_table": "NATION", "referencing_column": "n_regionkey", "referred_table": "REGION"}, {"referencing_table": "SUPPLIER", "referencing_column": "s_nationkey", "referred_table": "NATION"}, {"referencing_table": "CUSTOMER", "referencing_column": "c_nationkey", "referred_table": "NATION"}, {"referencing_table": "PARTSUPP", "referencing_column": "ps_suppkey", "referred_table": "SUPPLIER"}, {"referencing_table": "PARTSUPP", "referencing_column": "ps_partkey", "referred_table": "PART"}, {"referencing_table": "ORDER", "referencing_column": "o_custkey", "referred_table": "CUSTOMER"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_orderkey", "referred_table": "ORDER"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_partkey", "referred_table": "PART"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_suppkey", "referred_table": "SUPPLIER"}]}, "ground_truth_distributions": {"LINEITEM.l_quantity": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 50.0}}, "LINEITEM.l_discount": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 0.1}}, "LINEITEM.l_tax": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 0.08}}, "LINEITEM.l_linenumber": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 7.0}}, "PART.p_retailprice": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 900.0, "high": 2099.99}}, "PART.p_size": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 50.0}}, "PARTSUPP.ps_availqty": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 9999.0}}, "PARTSUPP.ps_supplycost": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 1000.0}}, "SUPPLIER.s_acctbal": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": -999.99, "high": 9999.99}}, "CUSTOMER.c_acctbal": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": -999.99, "high": 9999.99}}}}
{"id": "tpch-006", "level": "expert", "nl_description": "Relational schema for ad-hoc analytical queries on a global wholesale procurement system. Two dimension layers and two transactional layers. Geographic layer: 2-level hierarchy, 5 entries at the top level and 25 entries distributed approximately uniformly across it. Both counterparty types (buyers and vendors) are located at the leaf level. Catalog layer: an items table with roughly 200K distinct entries, classifiable by 5 manufacturers and 25 brands. An associative entity models supply relationships; typical cardinality is 800K rows from a 200K-by-4 product (items times suppliers per item). This relation carries a continuous uniform pricing attribute in [1.00, 1000.00] and integer inventory in [1, 9999]. Transactional layer 1 (order headers): 1.5M rows, sparse integer PK, one FK to the buyer counterparty. Transactional layer 2 (line items): ~6M rows, child of order headers, also carries two additional FKs to the catalog and supply layers forming a triangular constraint. Key derived attribute: net_charge = qty * list_price * (1 - disc) * (1 + tax). Constraints: qty in [1,50], disc in {0.00, ..., 0.10}, tax in {0.00, ..., 0.08}. Three temporal attributes on line items obey: ship_date > order_date, receipt_date >= ship_date. Seven categorical shipment modes, four dispatch instruction codes. Return status is a derived flag.", "ground_truth_schema": {"tables": [{"name": "REGION", "pk": "r_regionkey", "columns": [{"name": "r_regionkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "r_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "r_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "NATION", "pk": "n_nationkey", "columns": [{"name": "n_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "n_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "n_regionkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "n_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "SUPPLIER", "pk": "s_suppkey", "columns": [{"name": "s_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_address", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_phone", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_acctbal", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "s_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "CUSTOMER", "pk": "c_custkey", "columns": [{"name": "c_custkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_address", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_nationkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_phone", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_acctbal", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "c_mktsegment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "PART", "pk": "p_partkey", "columns": [{"name": "p_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "p_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_mfgr", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_brand", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_type", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_size", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "p_container", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "p_retailprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "p_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "PARTSUPP", "pk": "ps_partkey", "columns": [{"name": "ps_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_availqty", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ps_supplycost", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ps_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "ORDER", "pk": "o_orderkey", "columns": [{"name": "o_orderkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_custkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_orderstatus", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "o_totalprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "o_orderdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "o_orderpriority", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "o_clerk", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "o_shippriority", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "o_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "LINEITEM", "pk": "l_orderkey", "columns": [{"name": "l_orderkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_partkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_suppkey", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_linenumber", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "l_quantity", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_extendedprice", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_discount", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_tax", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "l_returnflag", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_linestatus", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_shipdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "l_commitdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "l_receiptdate", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "l_shipinstruct", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_shipmode", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "l_comment", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}], "relationships": [{"referencing_table": "NATION", "referencing_column": "n_regionkey", "referred_table": "REGION"}, {"referencing_table": "SUPPLIER", "referencing_column": "s_nationkey", "referred_table": "NATION"}, {"referencing_table": "CUSTOMER", "referencing_column": "c_nationkey", "referred_table": "NATION"}, {"referencing_table": "PARTSUPP", "referencing_column": "ps_suppkey", "referred_table": "SUPPLIER"}, {"referencing_table": "PARTSUPP", "referencing_column": "ps_partkey", "referred_table": "PART"}, {"referencing_table": "ORDER", "referencing_column": "o_custkey", "referred_table": "CUSTOMER"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_orderkey", "referred_table": "ORDER"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_partkey", "referred_table": "PART"}, {"referencing_table": "LINEITEM", "referencing_column": "l_suppkey", "referred_table": "SUPPLIER"}]}, "ground_truth_distributions": {"LINEITEM.l_quantity": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 50.0}}, "LINEITEM.l_discount": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 0.1}}, "LINEITEM.l_tax": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 0.08}}, "LINEITEM.l_linenumber": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 7.0}}, "PART.p_retailprice": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 900.0, "high": 2099.99}}, "PART.p_size": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 50.0}}, "PARTSUPP.ps_availqty": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 9999.0}}, "PARTSUPP.ps_supplycost": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 1000.0}}, "SUPPLIER.s_acctbal": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": -999.99, "high": 9999.99}}, "CUSTOMER.c_acctbal": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": -999.99, "high": 9999.99}}}}
